<!DOCTYPE html>

<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta
        name="viewport"
        content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"
    />
    <title>Verify Your Email - DistrictFix</title>
</head>

<body
    style="
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        background-color: #f4f7f6;
        font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
        color: #1f2937;
    "
>
    <table
        width="100%"
        cellpadding="0"
        cellspacing="0"
        border="0"
        style="
            background-color: #f4f7f6;
            padding: 40px 15px;
        "
    >
        <tr>
            <td align="center">

```
            <!-- Main Container -->
            <table
                width="100%"
                cellpadding="0"
                cellspacing="0"
                border="0"
                style="
                    max-width: 600px;
                    background-color: #ffffff;
                    border-radius: 12px;
                    overflow: hidden;
                    box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
                "
            >

                <!-- Header -->
                <tr>
                    <td
                        align="center"
                        style="
                            background-color: #00633c;
                            padding: 30px 20px;
                        "
                    >
                        <h1
                            style="
                                margin: 0;
                                color: #ffffff;
                                font-size: 28px;
                                font-weight: 700;
                            "
                        >
                            DistrictFix
                        </h1>

                        <p
                            style="
                                margin: 8px 0 0;
                                color: #d9f5e8;
                                font-size: 14px;
                            "
                        >
                            Your Local Problem-Solving Platform
                        </p>
                    </td>
                </tr>

                <!-- Content -->
                <tr>
                    <td
                        align="center"
                        style="
                            padding: 45px 35px;
                        "
                    >

                        <!-- Verification Icon -->
                        <div
                            style="
                                width: 70px;
                                height: 70px;
                                line-height: 70px;
                                margin: 0 auto 25px;
                                border-radius: 50%;
                                background-color: #e8f7f0;
                                color: #00633c;
                                font-size: 32px;
                                font-weight: bold;
                            "
                        >
                            ✓
                        </div>

                        <h2
                            style="
                                margin: 0 0 15px;
                                font-size: 26px;
                                color: #111827;
                            "
                        >
                            Verify Your Email
                        </h2>

                        <p
                            style="
                                margin: 0 0 10px;
                                font-size: 15px;
                                line-height: 1.7;
                                color: #4b5563;
                            "
                        >
                            Hello
                            <strong>
                                <%= name || "there" %>
                            </strong>,
                        </p>

                        <p
                            style="
                                max-width: 450px;
                                margin: 0 auto 25px;
                                font-size: 15px;
                                line-height: 1.7;
                                color: #4b5563;
                            "
                        >
                            Thank you for creating an account with
                            <strong>DistrictFix</strong>.
                            Please use the verification code below to
                            verify your email address and complete your
                            registration.
                        </p>

                        <!-- OTP Box -->
                        <table
                            width="100%"
                            cellpadding="0"
                            cellspacing="0"
                            border="0"
                        >
                            <tr>
                                <td align="center">
                                    <div
                                        style="
                                            display: inline-block;
                                            background-color: #f0fdf7;
                                            border: 2px dashed #00633c;
                                            border-radius: 10px;
                                            padding: 18px 35px;
                                            margin: 5px 0 25px;
                                        "
                                    >
                                        <p
                                            style="
                                                margin: 0 0 8px;
                                                font-size: 12px;
                                                color: #6b7280;
                                                text-transform: uppercase;
                                                letter-spacing: 2px;
                                            "
                                        >
                                            Verification Code
                                        </p>

                                        <h1
                                            style="
                                                margin: 0;
                                                font-size: 36px;
                                                letter-spacing: 8px;
                                                color: #00633c;
                                            "
                                        >
                                            <%= otp %>
                                        </h1>
                                    </div>
                                </td>
                            </tr>
                        </table>

                        <!-- Expiry -->
                        <p
                            style="
                                margin: 0 0 10px;
                                font-size: 14px;
                                line-height: 1.6;
                                color: #4b5563;
                            "
                        >
                            This verification code will expire in
                            <strong>5 minutes</strong>.
                        </p>

                        <p
                            style="
                                margin: 0 0 25px;
                                font-size: 14px;
                                line-height: 1.6;
                                color: #6b7280;
                            "
                        >
                            If you did not create a DistrictFix account,
                            you can safely ignore this email.
                        </p>

                        <!-- Security Notice -->
                        <div
                            style="
                                background-color: #f9fafb;
                                border-left: 4px solid #00633c;
                                padding: 14px 16px;
                                border-radius: 5px;
                                text-align: left;
                            "
                        >
                            <p
                                style="
                                    margin: 0;
                                    font-size: 13px;
                                    line-height: 1.6;
                                    color: #4b5563;
                                "
                            >
                                <strong>Security tip:</strong>
                                Never share this verification code with
                                anyone.
                            </p>
                        </div>

                    </td>
                </tr>

                <!-- Footer -->
                <tr>
                    <td
                        align="center"
                        style="
                            background-color: #f9fafb;
                            padding: 25px 20px;
                            border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
                        "
                    >
                        <p
                            style="
                                margin: 0 0 8px;
                                font-size: 13px;
                                color: #6b7280;
                            "
                        >
                            © <%= new Date().getFullYear() %>
                            DistrictFix
                        </p>

                        <p
                            style="
                                margin: 0;
                                font-size: 12px;
                                color: #9ca3af;
                            "
                        >
                            This is an automated email. Please do not
                            reply to this message.
                        </p>
                    </td>
                </tr>

            </table>

        </td>
    </tr>
</table>
```

</body>
</html>
